WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:08.798
Raoul and the Persian stood motionless, each holding his breath as the mirrored wall slid back into place. Then

2
00:00:08.799 --> 00:00:19.459
the Persian fumbled in the dark until he found a lantern he'd hidden. Turning it on, he shined a

3
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:24.487
dim light down the passage. "This must be the way that Erik reached Christine's dressing room," Raoul said. The

4
