00:00:34.344 --> 00:00:42.222
for, and Raoul heard a faint click. A square opening appeared in the floor, as if a window had

6
00:00:42.223 --> 00:00:52.906
opened on the opera house cellars. Turning off his lantern, the Persian whispered, "Follow me." The Persian hung by

