00:00:52.907 --> 00:00:58.948
his hands from the opening and dropped into the cellar below. Raoul hesitated for a second, wondering if this

8
00:00:59.471 --> 00:01:04.861
were some kind of trap. "But the Persian wouldn't have given me a pistol if he intended to harm

