00:01:04.862 --> 00:01:11.498
me," he decided. "Hurry up!" the Persian said. Slipping through the opening, Raoul landed on the floor. As the Persian led him through the labyrinth of passages, Raoul wondered what he'd have done without his guide. Somewhere in

