00:01:18.509 --> 00:01:29.494
shutters onstage!" The Persian pulled Raoul behind a piece of scenery. Raoul heard footsteps and saw shadows gliding through the dimly lit cellar. "Who are the door shutters?" Raoul asked. "Retired stagehands," the Persian said. "They're paid to

