00:02:41.128 --> 00:02:53.642
men." Raoul gulped. "What do you mean?" Before the Persian could answer, a startling sight appeared in the distance—a

22
00:02:55.005 --> 00:03:06.778
head of fire! The Persian looked surprised too. "Oh, I guess that fireman really did see a flaming head

23
00:03:06.779 --> 00:03:14.216
