24
00:03:14.217 --> 00:03:19.661
We'll be safer if we run." The two men fled down the long passage ahead of them. "He rarely

25
00:03:19.662 --> 00:03:23.317
comes to this part of the opera house," the Persian said. "This side doesn't lead to his house or

