29
00:03:44.936 --> 00:03:55.529
And listen, what's that noise?" Neither Raoul nor the Persian could identify the scratching, skittering sound that accompanied the

30
00:03:55.530 --> 00:04:03.560
flaming head. As the head drew closer, they could see round, staring eyes above a large nose and

31
00:04:03.561 --> 00:04:11.699
mouth. The two men ran, but the head was soon right behind them. Now Raoul knew what the sound

32
00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:19.884
was. He shouted and stamped his feet as small creatures with little legs scurried around his shoes. The Persian

33
